  {"table":"flavourtext","id":"UniqueShieldStr13","field":"Text","en":"\"The newcomers warn of doom and death beyond mortal ken.\r\nI ask, why should we fear the fire when we serve the Lord of Light?\"\r\n- Maxarius, the first High Templar","kind":"dat","sourceHash":"c10f59fe99acba4fbd6a01da9f88bc10f8da83078341a7b85f488f2f70c85efa","tw":"\"新人警告說，末日和死亡超越了凡人的視野。\r\n請問，我們侍奉光明之主，為什麼要怕火？\"\r\n- 初代聖宗．馬克薩留斯","cn":"“新来之人警告着凡人无法理解的毁灭和死亡。\r\n我反问到，既然我辈侍奉光之王，为何还要惧怕火焰？”\r\n— 首任神主玛萨留斯"},
